---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="About | Nick Ruffin">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <span class="about-tag reveal">ABOUT</span>
      <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Nick Ruffin</h1>
      <p class="about-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-2">Manager, Data Engineering &middot; RedSail Technologies</p>

      <div class="about-sections">
        <div class="about-section reveal">
          <h2>What I Do</h2>
          <p>I own commercial data delivery for RedSail's pharmacy-data monetization platform &mdash; <strong>nearly 40 live production feeds to 30+ pharma manufacturer, RWE, and pharmacy-services organizations</strong>. That spans <strong>18 manufacturer copay assistance and voucher discount programs</strong>, clinical program feeds, and the de-identified, patient-level tokenized claims data licensed for analytics on a 7-figure ARR platform.</p>
          <p>Two distinct motions. The program feeds are DUA-governed and operational, held to latency, coverage, and reliability commitments. The analytics products go out as tokenized de-identified feeds, as identified PHI into customer-controlled AWS or Azure environments for buyers running their own tokenization engines, and as cross-source combined feeds joining multiple pharmacy systems.</p>
          <p>Delivery runs across a multi-cloud estate &mdash; AWS and Azure, multiple Snowflake accounts on a medallion architecture. I am consolidating customer feeds onto a shared combined-feed pipeline to cut per-customer tokenization and processing cost, retiring redundant legacy pipelines while holding delivery continuity for every account.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section reveal">
          <h2>The Differentiation</h2>
          <p>Most RWE and pharma customer engineering teams know claims but not pharmacy transactions. I serve as the embedded translator on <strong>NCPDP-standard pharmacy-data fluency</strong> &mdash; join-key design, cross-source reconciliation, and file-format work &mdash; and provide the same technical framing on business development calls and contract reviews so commercial commitments match delivery reality.</p>
          <p>I partner with business development on deals from technical review through delivery execution: sit in on new-business conversations, review draft contracts for delivery feasibility, then execute end-to-end through engineering handoff and customer stakeholder communication. I coordinate cross-product data sourcing across RedSail alongside our VP.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section reveal">
          <h2>Regulatory &amp; Data Governance</h2>
          <p>HIPAA compliance, Expert Determination coordination with third-party evaluators, proof-of-delivery audit trails, and provenance documentation for customer legal reviews. Building the engineering function &mdash; hiring, code standards, deployment discipline (Airflow, Terraform, GitHub Actions) &mdash; to remove single-person dependencies from customer delivery.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section reveal">
          <h2>Technical Focus</h2>
          <div class="tech-grid">
            <div class="tech-category">
              <h3>Platform</h3>
              <p>Multi-cloud AWS + Azure; multiple Snowflake accounts on a medallion architecture (Procs/Streams/Tasks); AWS MWAA, S3, Lambda, Fargate, ECS, IAM</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-category">
              <h3>Delivery</h3>
              <p>third-party tokenization, Apache Airflow, Terraform, GitHub Actions, Python, SQL, HIPAA / Expert Determination</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-category">
              <h3>Data Products</h3>
              <p>Manufacturer copay assistance &amp; voucher discount program feeds, de-identified patient-level tokenized claims data, cross-source combined feeds, provenance &amp; audit</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section reveal">
          <h2>Background</h2>
          <p>Before RedSail I was Director, Full Stack Development at Nimble Solutions from 2021 to 2025. Reported to the CIO and led three functional engineering teams &mdash; software, data, and RPA, across US and offshore &mdash; through the company's inorganic growth phase. Technical partner to the CIO on four healthcare acquisitions; integrated 20+ practice management systems into a unified data warehouse via RPA-based extraction and API ingestion; shipped an AR reimbursement work queue that lifted rep throughput to 30+ claims/day.</p>
          <p>Prior to Nimble, four years as Senior Full Stack Developer at Core &amp; Main building enterprise data applications on C#/.NET and SQL. Twelve years of engineering across pharmacy, healthcare data, and enterprise systems. Bachelor of Science in Computer Science, University of Phoenix.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-cta reveal">
        <a href="/nicholas-ruffin-resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="cta-button">Download Resume</a>
        <a href="/experience" class="secondary-link">See experience &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function initMolecules() {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('molecule-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
      if (!canvas) return;
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) return;
      let w = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
      let h = canvas.height = canvas.parentElement!.scrollHeight;
      let animId: number;

      interface Atom { x: number; y: number; vx: number; vy: number; radius: number; hue: number; }
      const atoms: Atom[] = [];
      const count = Math.min(35, Math.floor(w * h / 30000));

      for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
        atoms.push({
          x: Math.random() * w, y: Math.random() * h,
          vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.4, vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.4,
          radius: 3 + Math.random() * 4,
          hue: 265 + Math.random() * 35,
        });
      }

      function draw() {
        ctx!.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);
        // Draw bonds
        for (let i = 0; i < atoms.length; i++) {
          for (let j = i + 1; j < atoms.length; j++) {
            const dx = atoms[i].x - atoms[j].x;
            const dy = atoms[i].y - atoms[j].y;
            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
            if (dist < 150) {
              ctx!.beginPath();
              ctx!.moveTo(atoms[i].x, atoms[i].y);
              ctx!.lineTo(atoms[j].x, atoms[j].y);
              ctx!.strokeStyle = `hsla(280, 60%, 60%, ${0.15 * (1 - dist / 150)})`;
              ctx!.lineWidth = 1;
              ctx!.stroke();
            }
          }
        }
        // Draw atoms
        for (const a of atoms) {
          a.x += a.vx; a.y += a.vy;
          if (a.x < 0 || a.x > w) a.vx *= -1;
          if (a.y < 0 || a.y > h) a.vy *= -1;

          const glow = ctx!.createRadialGradient(a.x, a.y, 0, a.x, a.y, a.radius * 4);
          glow.addColorStop(0, `hsla(${a.hue}, 80%, 70%, 0.4)`);
          glow.addColorStop(1, `hsla(${a.hue}, 80%, 60%, 0)`);
          ctx!.fillStyle = glow;
          ctx!.beginPath();
          ctx!.arc(a.x, a.y, a.radius * 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx!.fill();

          ctx!.beginPath();
          ctx!.arc(a.x, a.y, a.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx!.fillStyle = `hsla(${a.hue}, 90%, 75%, 0.7)`;
          ctx!.fill();
        }
        animId = requestAnimationFrame(draw);
      }
      draw();
      window.addEventListener('resize', () => { w = canvas.width = window.innerWidth; h = canvas.height = canvas.parentElement!.scrollHeight; });
      document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => cancelAnimationFrame(animId));
    }
    initMolecules();
    document.addEventListener('astro:after-swap', initMolecules);
  </script>

  <style>
    .about-container {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: var(--background-color);
      color: var(--text-color);
      padding: 110px 24px 80px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    #molecule-canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
    .about-content { max-width: 680px; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .about-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 22px; display: block; }
    .about-content h1 { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .about-subtitle { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .about-sections { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; }
    .about-section h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-color); }
    .about-section p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .about-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .about-list li { padding: 12px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .about-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .about-list li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--primary-color); border-radius: 50%; }
    .about-list li strong { color: var(--text-color); }
    .tech-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .tech-category { background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.3s; }
    .tech-category:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .tech-category h3 { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--primary-color); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .tech-category p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0; }
    .about-cta { margin-top: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
    .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background: #191918; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--primary-glow); }
    .cta-button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); }
    .secondary-link { color: var(--primary-color); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; transition: opacity 0.3s; }
    .secondary-link:hover { opacity: 0.7; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .about-content h1 { font-size: 36px; } .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about-cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; } }
  </style>
</MainLayout>
